-- Exact Dadda 64x64 compressor counts: 3,843 full adders + 63 half adders reduce 4,096 partial products to <= 2 rows
-- Check wire-count conservation: each FA reduces total bits by 1 (3 -> 2), each HA by 0 (2 -> 2);
-- 4096 - 3843 = 253 final wires across 128 columns (cols 0,127 have 1 wire, cols 1..126 have 2 wires: 1 + 126*2 + 0 = 253).
dadda64-wire-conservation : Path Word (%wsub #4096 #3843) #253
dadda64-wire-conservation = refl
